{"content_hash": "8878e27f679f91b8", "version_id": 994, "article_id": 100, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Beats and Pokémon team up on a special edition Pill speaker", "title_zh": "Beats联名宝可梦推出特别版Pill音箱，一开卖就被抢空", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "toodaylab", "source_url": "https://www.toodaylab.com/84293", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610366398516-46da9dec5931?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YmVhdHMlMjBkZXNrJTIwc2V0dXB8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDg4ODI4OHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Amr Taha™ on Unsplash", "author": "Amr Taha™", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@amr_taha?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-flat-screen-computer-monitor-on-brown-wooden-desk-SMMqej67qjI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(350, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(28, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "40a674dce8b1"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-17", "word_count": 275, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Beats has launched a special edition of its Pill speaker in partnership with The Pokémon Company, and it sold out quickly. The design goes far beyond putting two logos together, and it shows how far a brand collaboration can go.", "lead_zh": "Beats与宝可梦国际公司合作推出了Pill音箱特别版，开卖后很快售罄。这次设计远不止把两个标志放在一起，也展示了品牌联名能做到什么程度。", "preview": "The special edition went on sale on 13 October and was sold only through Apple's online store and Beats' official Douyin shop. It soon sold ", "preview_zh": "这款特别版于10月13日开售，仅在苹果官网商店和Beats抖音官方旗舰店销售。它很快就售罄了，如今想以原价买到并不容易。一些代购渠道开出了两三倍的价格，可见反响之热烈。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 977, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 94.1, "size_bytes": 565488, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 96.675, "size_bytes": 581040, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 102.7, "size_bytes": 617184, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 87.85, "size_bytes": 528048, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 96.025, "size_bytes": 577152, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@dcdf7bea/content/data/versions/994.json", "paragraphs": ["The special edition went on sale on 13 October and was sold only through Apple's online store and Beats' official Douyin shop. It soon sold out, so buying one at the original price is now difficult. Some resale channels are asking two or three times the normal price, which shows how strong the response has been.", "The care starts with the parcel. Inside the shipping box, the speaker sits among lightning-bolt shapes, and the release date is printed on both sides. The packaging itself has two faces, one showing Pikachu and one showing Mimikyu, and the ears on both characters can be folded up so the box becomes a stand.", "The speaker's front mesh also features Pikachu and Mimikyu, and the metal lightning bolts around Pikachu are set into the surface rather than printed, which gives the image a three-dimensional feel. A charm on the strap shows a Poké Ball on one side and the Beats logo on the other. It is the first Beats Pill to come with a charm.", "Beyond the design, the Pill is a practical speaker. Its silicone body protects it from knocks and keeps it steady while playing, and its IP67 rating means it can be used in the bathroom, by a pool or outdoors. One-button pairing, a 24-hour battery and clear, powerful sound make it hard to fault.", "The special edition costs the same as the standard model, so buyers get the extra design at no extra charge. Beats' chief marketing officer, Chris Thorne, said Pokémon trainers are among the most passionate groups in the world. The collaboration suggests future Beats partnerships may go further than simple logo swaps."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这款特别版于10月13日开售，仅在苹果官网商店和Beats抖音官方旗舰店销售。它很快就售罄了，如今想以原价买到并不容易。一些代购渠道开出了两三倍的价格，可见反响之热烈。", "用心之处从包裹就开始了。快递箱里，音箱被闪电元素环绕，两侧印着发售日期。包装盒本身有两面，分别印着皮卡丘和谜拟丘，两个角色的耳朵都能翻起来，让盒子变成立牌。", "音箱正面网罩上同样有皮卡丘和谜拟丘，皮卡丘周围的金属闪电是嵌在表面而非印制的，让画面有了立体感。挂绳上的挂饰一面是精灵球，另一面是Beats标志。这是Beats Pill首次配备挂饰。", "除了设计，Pill本身也很实用。硅胶机身能缓冲碰撞，播放时保持稳定，IP67防护等级意味着它可以在浴室、泳池边或户外使用。一键配对、24小时续航和清晰有力的声音让它几乎挑不出毛病。", "特别版与普通版定价一致，买家不用多花钱就能得到额外设计。Beats首席营销官Chris Thorne表示，宝可梦训练家是全球最热情的群体之一。这次合作或许预示着Beats未来的联名会走得更远，而不只是简单交换标志。"], "body": "The special edition went on sale on 13 October and was sold only through Apple's online store and Beats' official Douyin shop. It soon sold out, so buying one at the original price is now difficult. Some resale channels are asking two or three times the normal price, which shows how strong the response has been.\n\nThe care starts with the parcel. Inside the shipping box, the speaker sits among lightning-bolt shapes, and the release date is printed on both sides. The packaging itself has two faces, one showing Pikachu and one showing Mimikyu, and the ears on both characters can be folded up so the box becomes a stand.\n\nThe speaker's front mesh also features Pikachu and Mimikyu, and the metal lightning bolts around Pikachu are set into the surface rather than printed, which gives the image a three-dimensional feel. A charm on the strap shows a Poké Ball on one side and the Beats logo on the other. It is the first Beats Pill to come with a charm.\n\nBeyond the design, the Pill is a practical speaker. Its silicone body protects it from knocks and keeps it steady while playing, and its IP67 rating means it can be used in the bathroom, by a pool or outdoors. One-button pairing, a 24-hour battery and clear, powerful sound make it hard to fault.\n\nThe special edition costs the same as the standard model, so buyers get the extra design at no extra charge. Beats' chief marketing officer, Chris Thorne, said Pokémon trainers are among the most passionate groups in the world. The collaboration suggests future Beats partnerships may go further than simple logo swaps.", "body_zh": "这款特别版于10月13日开售，仅在苹果官网商店和Beats抖音官方旗舰店销售。它很快就售罄了，如今想以原价买到并不容易。一些代购渠道开出了两三倍的价格，可见反响之热烈。\n\n用心之处从包裹就开始了。快递箱里，音箱被闪电元素环绕，两侧印着发售日期。包装盒本身有两面，分别印着皮卡丘和谜拟丘，两个角色的耳朵都能翻起来，让盒子变成立牌。\n\n音箱正面网罩上同样有皮卡丘和谜拟丘，皮卡丘周围的金属闪电是嵌在表面而非印制的，让画面有了立体感。挂绳上的挂饰一面是精灵球，另一面是Beats标志。这是Beats Pill首次配备挂饰。\n\n除了设计，Pill本身也很实用。硅胶机身能缓冲碰撞，播放时保持稳定，IP67防护等级意味着它可以在浴室、泳池边或户外使用。一键配对、24小时续航和清晰有力的声音让它几乎挑不出毛病。\n\n特别版与普通版定价一致，买家不用多花钱就能得到额外设计。Beats首席营销官Chris Thorne表示，宝可梦训练家是全球最热情的群体之一。这次合作或许预示着Beats未来的联名会走得更远，而不只是简单交换标志。", "text": "The special edition went on sale on 13 October and was sold only through Apple's online store and Beats' official Douyin shop. It soon sold out, so buying one at the original price is now difficult. Some resale channels are asking two or three times the normal price, which shows how strong the response has been. The care starts with the parcel. Inside the shipping box, the speaker sits among lightning-bolt shapes, and the release date is printed on both sides. The packaging itself has two faces, one showing Pikachu and one showing Mimikyu, and the ears on both characters can be folded up so the box becomes a stand. The speaker's front mesh also features Pikachu and Mimikyu, and the metal lightning bolts around Pikachu are set into the surface rather than printed, which gives the image a three-dimensional feel. A charm on the strap shows a Poké Ball on one side and the Beats logo on the other. It is the first Beats Pill to come with a charm. Beyond the design, the Pill is a practical speaker. Its silicone body protects it from knocks and keeps it steady while playing, and its IP67 rating means it can be used in the bathroom, by a pool or outdoors. One-button pairing, a 24-hour battery and clear, powerful sound make it hard to fault. The special edition costs the same as the standard model, so buyers get the extra design at no extra charge. Beats' chief marketing officer, Chris Thorne, said Pokémon trainers are among the most passionate groups in the world. The collaboration suggests future Beats partnerships may go further than simple logo swaps.", "vocab": [{"word": "special edition", "pos": "noun", "zh": "特别版", "note": "指在常规产品基础上推出限量或特别设计的版本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "collaboration", "pos": "noun", "zh": "联名合作", "note": "品牌之间合作常用词，比 cooperation 更强调共同创作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sell out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "售罄", "note": "常用被动 sold out，如 It soon sold out", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "resale", "pos": "noun", "zh": "转售、代购", "note": "resale channels 指二手或代购渠道", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "packaging", "pos": "noun", "zh": "包装", "note": "不可数名词，指产品外包装", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fold up", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "折叠起来", "note": "描述可翻折的结构", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "three-dimensional", "pos": "adj", "zh": "立体的", "note": "常形容有层次感的设计或效果", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "c